|content1=
* August 20th - '''Passion UA''' is founded and enter ''[[Counter-Strike: Global Offensive]]'' with a roster consisting of [[marat2k]], [[jambo]], [[jackasmo]], [[zeRRoFIX]], [[s-chilla]], and [[kane]], the latter as the team's coach. <ref name="passion cs">{{cite web|url=https://www.instagram.com/p/CwLjuItsPLK/|title=З радістю оголошуємо про офіційний запуск абсолютно нової кіберспортивної команди!|trans_title=We're excited to announce the official launch of a brand new esports team!|language={{Flag|ua}} Ukrainian|date=2023-08-20|author='''Passion UA'''}}</ref>

|content2=
* February 17th - '''Passion UA''' bench [[marat2k]] and sign [[fear]]. <ref name="marat benched">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/passionuagg/status/1758884835144139007|title=Today we're benching our captain Kyryl "marat2k" Samsoniuk|date=2024-02-17|author='''Passion UA'''}}</ref><ref name="+fear">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/PassionuaGG/status/1758899556794749142|title=Please welcome the new captain of Passion UA — @fear10_cs|date=2024-02-17|author='''Passion UA'''}}</ref>
* March 2nd - '''Passion UA''' release [[marat2k]]. <ref name="-marat">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/marat2kcsgo/status/1763885795503468561|title=Officially Free Agent|date=2024-03-02|author=[[marat2k]]}}</ref>

|content3=
* January 1st - '''Passion UA''' part ways with [[s-chilla]]. <ref name="-chilla">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/passionuagg/status/1874516543805006062|title=Time to say thank you|date=2025-01-01|author='''Passion UA'''}}</ref>
* January 2nd - '''Passion UA''' part ways with [[fear]]. <ref name="-fear">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/passionuagg/status/1874863307003179125|title=Goodbye, @fEAR10cs|date=2025-01-02|author='''Passion UA'''}}</ref>
* January 4th - '''Passion UA''' sign [[Topa]]. <ref name="+topa">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/PassionuaGG/status/1875588574692962789|title=Meet our new captain|date=2025-01-04|author='''Passion UA'''}}</ref>
* January 6th - '''Passion UA''' acquire [[Kvem]] from [[IKLA]]. <ref name="+kvem">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/passionuagg/status/1876297678000152638|title=WELCOME TO OUR FAMILY, @Kvem_csgo|date=2025-01-06|author='''Passion UA'''}}</ref>
* March 21st - '''Passion UA''' add [[s-chilla]] as a stand-in while [[jambo]] is acquired by [[Fnatic]]. <ref name="+s-chilla">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/PassionuaGG/status/1903164714320007343|title=Back in action. @s_4illa is home|date=2025-03-21|author='''Passion UA'''}}</ref><ref name="-jambo">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/PassionuaGG/status/1903162206793109876|title=Dmytro @csjambo moves to @FNATICCS2|date=2025-03-21|author='''Passion UA'''}}</ref>
* April 3rd - '''Passion UA''' part ways with [[kane]]. <ref name="-kane">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/PassionuaGG/status/1907840382710190419|title=We’re saying goodbye to @navi_kane , head coach of Passion UA|date=2025-04-03|author='''Passion UA'''}}</ref>
* April 4th - '''Passion UA''' part ways with [[s-chilla]], acquire [[Woro2k]] from [[Monte]], and sign [[T.c]] as their new coach. <ref name="-s-chilla 2025">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/PassionuaGG/status/1908142521563087122|title=Big thanks to @s_4illa for jumping in during a tough time and having our back when we needed it most|date=2025-04-04|author='''Passion UA'''}}</ref><ref name="+T.c">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/PassionuaGG/status/1908112305033810098|title=Welcome the new head coach of Passion UA|date=2025-04-04|author='''Passion UA'''}}</ref><ref name="+woro">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/PassionuaGG/status/1908203060637184134|title=Codename: Woro2k|date=2025-04-04|author='''Passion UA'''}}</ref>
* April 6th - '''Passion UA''' part ways with [[zeRRoFIX]]. <ref name="-zeRRoFIX">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/PassionuaGG/status/1908897474611130456|title=It’s been a wild journey, bro @_zeRRoFIX_|date=2025-04-06|author='''Passion UA'''}}</ref>
* April 7th - '''Passion UA''' acquire [[DemQQ]] from [[Monte]]. <ref name="+DemQQ">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/PassionuaGG/status/1909186065954468197|title=Reunited with his brother-in arms @woro2k|date=2025-04-07|author='''Passion UA'''}}</ref>
* May 30th - '''Passion UA''' sign [[Munstur]] as an assistant coach. <ref name="+munstur">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/PassionuaGG/status/1928398865696186661|title=Meet the new Assistant Coach of Passion UA, @munsturCS|date=2025-05-30|author='''Passion UA'''}}</ref>
* August 15th - '''Passion UA''' part ways with [[Topa]] and [[Woro2k]] and bench [[jackasmo]], [[Kvem]], and [[DemQQ]]. <ref name="-passion ua 2025">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/PassionuaGG/status/1956235332518576345|title=Passion UA announces roster changes|date=2025-08-15|author='''Passion UA'''}}</ref>
* August 19th - '''Passion UA''' reinstate [[Kvem]] back into the active roster and acquire [[JT]], [[Grim]], [[hallzerk]] and [[nicx]] from [[Complexity]]. <ref name="passion ua 2025">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/PassionuaGG/status/1957910458280669467|title=MEET THE NEW PASSION UA ROSTER|date=2025-08-19|author='''Passion UA'''}}</ref>
* October 10th - '''Passion UA''' loan [[jackasmo]] to [[Fnatic]]. <ref name="jackasmo loan">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/passionuagg/status/1976635172985700610|title=There are players who symbolize a beginning, for us, that is @jackASM0|date=2025-10-10|author='''Passion UA'''}}</ref>

|content4=
* January 20th - [[DemQQ]] is acquired by [[Eternal Fire]]. <ref name="-DemQQ">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/eternalfiregg/status/2013703089270759718|title=@demqqqq is leaving Passion UA|date=2026-01-20|author='''Passion UA'''}}</ref><ref name="EF DemQQ">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/eternalfiregg/status/2013703089270759718|title=The missing piece is finally in place|date=2026-01-20|author=[[Eternal Fire]]}}</ref>
* February 13th - '''Passion UA''' acquire [[try]] and [[Senzu]] from [[Imperial Esports]] and [[The MongolZ]], respectively, the latter on loan. <ref name="+try">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/passionuagg/status/2022355137780736028|title=¡Buenos días|date=2026-02-13|author='''Passion UA'''}}</ref><ref name="+senzu">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/passionuagg/status/2022370293868638303|title=You know what 13 means|date=2026-02-13|author='''Passion UA'''}}</ref>
* February 14th - '''Passion UA''' bench [[hallzerk]]. <ref name="hallzerk bench">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/PassionuaGG/status/2022628218088329672|title=Håkon @hallzerk moves to the bench — grateful for his impact and the energy he gave the squad|date=2026-02-14|author='''Passion UA'''}}</ref>
* February 26th - '''Passion UA''' bench [[Grim]]. <ref name="Grim bench">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/PassionuaGG/status/2027005746311754133|title=Michael @1grimcs moves to the bench|date=2026-02-26|author='''Passion UA'''}}</ref>
* February 28th - [[Grim]] is acquired by [[NRG]]. <ref name="-Grim">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/PassionuaGG/status/2027821149317480727|title=@1grimcs will continue his career with @nrgcs2|date=2026-02-28|author='''Passion UA'''}}</ref>
* April 27th - '''Passion UA''' part ways with [[Senzu]] upon the expiration of his loan. <ref name="-Senzu loan">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/PassionuaGG/status/2048791247448375743|title=Today we say goodbye to @Senzucs|date=2026-04-27|author='''Passion UA'''}}</ref>
* May 24th - '''Passion UA''' part ways with [[Munstur]]. <ref name="-munstur">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/PassionuaGG/status/2058518975252771154|title=Assistant coach @munsturCS leaves Passion UA|date=2026-05-24|author='''Passion UA'''}}</ref>
* June 17th - [[try]] is recalled to [[Imperial Esports]] after the organization terminates his sale to '''Passion UA'''. <ref name="try recalled">{{cite web|url=https://imperialesports.gg/updatetry/|title=Atualização: Santino “Try” Rigal – Imperial Esports|trans_title=Update: Santino “Try” Rigal – Imperial Esports|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2026-06-17|publisher=[[Imperial Esports]]}}</ref>
* June 23rd - [[jackasmo]] is acquired by [[Fnatic]] on a permanent basis. <ref name="-jackasmo">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/FNATICCS2/status/2069428975735054582|title=Jackasmo Contract News when|date=2026-06-23|author=[[Fnatic]]}}</ref>
* June 26th - '''Passion UA''' part ways with [[Kvem]] upon the expiration of his contract. <ref name="-kvem">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/Kvem_csgo/status/2070475141813834173|title=After my journey with Passion UA, my contract has come to an end|date=2026-06-26|author=[[Kvem]]}}</ref>
* July 8th - [[nicx]] is acquired by [[Marsborne]]. <ref name="marsborne nicx">{{cite web|url=https://www.dust2.us/news/75789/breaking-marsborne-sign-nicx|title=Breaking: Marsborne sign nicx|publisher=[[Dust2.us]]|date=2026-07-08|author=[[Mnmzzz]]}}</ref>
* July 9th - [[hallzerk]] is acquired by [[NRG]]. <ref name="-hallzerk">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/nrgcs2/status/2075279230301024674|title=NA STANDS FOR NORWEGIAN AWPER|date=2026-07-09|author=[[NRG]]}}</ref>
* July 22nd - [[JT]] is acquired by [[Team Liquid]]. <ref name="-JT">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/TeamLiquidCS/status/2079884187255923048|title=The elephant in the room has finally been addressed, and the rumors are true|date=2026-07-22|author=[[Team Liquid]]}}</ref>
