'''ShindeN''' is an [[:Category:Argentina|Argentinian]] esports organization founded on July 11, 2024 by singer Mauro "[[:wikipedia:Lit Killah|Lit Killah]]" Monzón and streamer Ivan "[[:wikipedia:Spreen|Spreen]]" Buhajeruk.

==Timeline==
{{Tabs dynamic
|name1=2024
|name2=2025
|name3=2026
|This=3

|content1=
* August 29th - '''ShindeN''' enter ''[[Counter-Strike 2]]'' by signing a roster consisting of [[abizz]], [[BK1]], [[ivz]], [[ABM]], [[roy]] and [[RUGO]], the latter as the coach. Additionally, they sign [[peqexino]] as an assistant coach. <ref name="ShindeN 2024"> {{cite web|url=https://x.com/ShindeNgg/status/1829323154793075069|date=2024-08-29|title=Bienvenidos a ShindeN|trans_title=Welcome to ShindeN|language={{Flag|ar}} Spanish|author='''ShindeN'''}}</ref>
* September 12th - '''ShindeN''' part ways with [[ABM]]. <ref name="-abm"> {{cite web|url=https://x.com/ShindeNgg/status/1834346902974066776|date=2024-09-12|title=Muchas gracias @ABMP9_|trans_title=Thank you very much @ABMP9_|language={{Flag|ar}} Spanish|author='''ShindeN'''}}</ref>
* September 22nd - '''ShindeN''' sign [[relentless]]. <ref name="+relentless"> {{cite web|url=https://x.com/ShindeNgg/status/1837886032009699805|date=2024-09-22|title=Bienvenido a ShindeN' @relentlessfps1|trans_title=Welcome to ShindeN' @relentlessfps1|language={{Flag|ar}} Spanish|author='''ShindeN'''}}</ref>

|content2=
