* January 14th - '''ShindeN''' sign [[nacho]] to complete their lineup. <ref name="+nacho"> {{cite web|url=https://x.com/ShindeNgg/status/1879177553820492136|date=2025-01-14|title=Bienvenido a ShindeN' @nachocsg0|trans_title=Welcome to ShindeN' @nachocsg0|language={{Flag|ar}} Spanish|author='''ShindeN'''}}</ref>
* April 14th - '''ShindeN''' part ways with [[roy]]. <ref name="-roy">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/ShindeNgg/status/1911804136695496986|title=Por motivos personales, @roycs_  decide dar un paso al costado de nuestro roster de CS2|trans_title=For personal reasons, @roycs_ decides to step down from our CS2 roster|language={{Flag|ar}} Spanish|date=2025-04-14|author='''ShindeN'''}}</ref>
* April 15th - '''ShindeN''' sign [[naz]]. <ref name="+naz">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/ShindeNgg/status/1912242150294552932|title=Bienvenido @naz_cs a ShindeN'|trans_title=Welcome @naz_cs to ShindeN'|language={{Flag|ar}} Spanish|date=2025-04-15|author='''ShindeN'''}}</ref>
* November 21st - '''ShindeN''' bench [[BK1]]. <ref name="bk1 bench">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/ShindeNgg/status/1991924859274981714|title=Desde hoy @bk1cs pasará al banco de nuestro roster de CS2 hasta el termino de su contrato, quedando desde hoy habilitado para escuchar ofertas|trans_title=From today, @bk1cs will be on the bench of our CS2 roster until the end of his contract, and from today he is eligible to listen to offers|language={{Flag|ar}} Spanish|date=2025-11-21|author='''ShindeN'''}}</ref>

|content3=
* January 3rd - '''ShindeN''' release [[BK1]]. <ref name="-BK1">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/bk1cs/status/2007560466265190422|title=Hoy me encuentro libre de contrato y listo para el 2026|trans_title=Today I am free of contract and ready for 2026|language={{Flag|ar}} Spanish|date=2026-01-03|author=[[BK1]]}}</ref>
* January 9th - '''ShindeN''' sign [[tom1jed]] to complete their lineup. <ref name="+tom1jed">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/ShindeNgg/status/2009777337815208178|title=BIENVENIDO @tom1jed|trans_title=WELCOME @tom1jed|language={{Flag|ar}} Spanish|date=2026-01-09|author='''ShindeN'''}}</ref>
* February 7th - '''ShindeN''' part ways with [[nacho]]. <ref name="-nacho">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/ShindeNgg/status/2020135674330935485|title=Tras un año de trabajo compartido, nos despedimos de @nachocsg0|trans_title=After a year of working together, we say goodbye to @nachocsg0|language={{Flag|ar}} Spanish|date=2026-02-07|author='''ShindeN'''}}</ref>
* February 14th - '''ShindeN''' acquire [[FraGuTy]] from [[Isurus]]. <ref name="+FraGuTy">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/ShindeNgg/status/2022707154566742241|title=Tenemos una cita @FraGuTyy?|trans_title=Do we have a date, @FraGuTyy?|language={{Flag|ar}} Spanish|date=2026-02-13|author='''ShindeN'''}}</ref>
* May 21st - '''ShindeN''' part ways with [[RUGO]]. <ref name="-RUGO">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/ShindeNgg/status/2057612403282706688|title=Hoy nos despedimos de @rugocsgo|trans_title=Today we say goodbye to @rugocsgo|language={{Flag|ar}} Spanish|date=2026-05-21|author='''ShindeN'''}}</ref>
* May 26th - '''ShindeN''' sign [[ninro]] as their new coach. <ref name="+ninro">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/ShindeNgg/status/2059424347178012730|title=Bienvenido @ninrocs, nuevo coach de ShindeN'|trans_title=Welcome @ninrocs, ShindeN's new coach|language={{Flag|ar}} Spanish|date=2026-05-26|author='''ShindeN'''}}</ref>

